"""Музыка: a music service in large type, playing in the background.

The first page shows the service's collections as tiles (Моя волна, Мне
нравится, one's playlists) and a search field; a tile or a search fills the
list under them, and a tap on a track plays from it on. A radio (Моя волна)
plays on and on, fetching more as it goes. The bar at the bottom shows the
track and holds back, pause and on, and the time bar seeks.

Closing the window while music plays only hides it: the music goes on, and
the program's tile on the home screen brings the same window back. While it
plays, $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/b8k-awake/<pid>.suspend keeps the tablet from
sleeping when the screen goes off (b8k-sleep); the screen itself may go off.

Services are the sources package next to this file (or in
/usr/local/lib/b8k-music): Яндекс Музыка now, others the same way. Playback
is libmpv through python-mpv, sound only.
"""
